WEBVTT

00:12:59.647 --> 00:13:02.368
Kako bi odgovorili na to složeno pitanje,

00:13:02.368 --> 00:13:05.019
potrebno je da ljudi različitih kadrova --

00:13:05.019 --> 00:13:07.223
laboranti i kliničari,

00:13:07.223 --> 00:13:09.613
socijalni radnici i političari,

00:13:09.613 --> 00:13:12.236
filantropisti i borci za ljudska prava

00:13:12.236 --> 00:13:14.162
rade zajedno.

00:13:14.162 --> 00:13:15.849
Smatram da trebamo

00:13:15.849 --> 00:13:17.487
promijeniti vlastite amigdale,

00:13:17.487 --> 00:13:20.268
jer problem je u srži

00:13:20.268 --> 00:13:22.039
ne samo Joa,

00:13:22.039 --> 00:13:23.951
nego i nas samih.

00:13:23.951 --> 00:13:26.931
Trebamo promijeniti pogleda na Joa

00:13:26.931 --> 00:13:30.733
kao beznadne osobe,